            'Add one required, unchecked checkbox "I agree to the automatic renewal terms above"; the button label can stay.',
            "Vermont requires an opt-in to the automatic renewal in addition to accepting the contract (9 V.S.A. \xA7 2454a(a)(2), plans with a first term of a year or more). Whether a labelled button alone is that opt-in is not settled law (the HelloFresh judgment was a stipulated settlement, not precedent)."
